# Artifacts are replayed on whichever machine checks them out, so their bytes
# are part of the contract. Normalize to LF in the repository and on checkout
# for every text file, so a Windows recording and a mac recording of the same
# flow differ only where the flow differs -- not on every line.
*.py    text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
*.yaml  text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.jsonl text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.txt   text eol=lf
